From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8350-b2q: describe how the cameras are mounted

Give the three camera nodes the rotation stock declares as
sensor-position-roll (90 for the rear wide and ultrawide, 270 for the
front) and the ultrawide its orientation, so the sensor drivers expose
V4L2_CID_CAMERA_ORIENTATION and V4L2_CID_CAMERA_SENSOR_ROTATION and
libcamera can report the location and rotate images upright.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts |    8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
index 4cf7c1a..627194f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
@@ -2440,6 +2440,8 @@
 		vif-supply = <&s2mpb02_l8>;
 
 		orientation = <1>;
+		/* Stock sensor-position-roll 90 (qcom,cam-sensor0) */
+		rotation = <90>;
 
 		port {
 			cam_wide_ep: endpoint {
@@ -2474,6 +2476,8 @@
 		vif-supply = <&s2mpb02_l9>;
 
 		orientation = <0>;
+		/* Stock sensor-position-roll 270 (qcom,cam-sensor1) */
+		rotation = <270>;
 
 		port {
 			cam_front_ep: endpoint {
@@ -2511,6 +2515,10 @@
 		vdig-supply = <&s2mpb02_l4>;
 		vif-supply = <&s2mpb02_l10>;
 
+		orientation = <1>;
+		/* Stock sensor-position-roll 90 (qcom,cam-sensor2) */
+		rotation = <90>;
+
 		port {
 			cam_uw_ep: endpoint {
 				link-frequencies = /bits/ 64 <633600000>;
